      "instance_name": "humiliation",
      "label": "the expression of humiliation",
      "description": "The pouting, defiant facial expression of Donald Trump, combined with the text overlay, conveys a sense of humiliation and defeat. The expression is interpreted as a reaction to being beaten up by a girl, which is framed as a comedic and mocking scenario. The emotion is derived from the visual expression and the textual narrative that contextualizes it as a humiliating defeat.",
